  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2022 HOMF: MUSICA PARA TODOS - ECOBAND</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;Musica para Todos &#x2013; Eco&#x2019;Band&#x2019; project, aims to promote an Eco-music approach with construction of music instruments with recycled material and green solutions.  The objectives of the grant are to support skills development for self-employment and job opportunities and creation of an Eco&#x2019;Band for youth, IDPs, women, artisans, music teachers.  The key activities include training youth in Pemba and Maputo, supporting a communication intern, establishing a new band, supporting income generation, delivered in partnership with local NGO Hakuna Matata</narrative>
  </description>
